{
  "id": "the-simpsons---6x13---and-maggie-makes-three",
  "title": "The Simpsons - 6x13 - And Maggie Makes Three",
  "sourceFilename": "The Simpsons - 6x13 - And Maggie Makes Three.en.srt",
  "importedAt": "2026-09-19T20:06:05.151Z",
  "lineCount": 291,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "And Maggie Makes Three",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 3608,
      "endMs": 5621
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "We now return to Knightboat: The Crime-Solving Boat.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 29481,
      "endMs": 33038
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Faster, Knightboat. Gotta catch those starfish poachers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 33239,
      "endMs": 35655
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Don't have to yell, Michael. I'm all around you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 35856,
      "endMs": 38105
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Oh, no. They're headed for land.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 39145,
      "endMs": 41192
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "We'll never catch them now. Incorrect. Look, a canal.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 45185,
      "endMs": 48239
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Go, Knightboat, go. Every week, there's a canal.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 48440,
      "endMs": 51528
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Or an inlet. Or a fjord.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 51695,
      "endMs": 53709
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Quiet! I won't hear another word against the boat.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 53910,
      "endMs": 56125
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Okay, TV off. It's family time. But, Marge...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 56293,
      "endMs": 60219
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "...Knightboat: The Crime-Solving Boat.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 60420,
      "endMs": 63877
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Homer, you promised, one night of family time a week.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 64111,
      "endMs": 67098
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Besides, that back-talking boat sets a bad example.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 67266,
      "endMs": 70387
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "Says you, woman.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 70588,
      "endMs": 71830
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "Hey, what are you doing? Mom.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 72031,
      "endMs": 73675
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "All right, family time begins now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 73877,
      "endMs": 76494
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "Homer. It was Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 85185,
      "endMs": 86695
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "Why don't we all look at the photo album.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 86863,
      "endMs": 89011
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "So many memories.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 89179,
      "endMs": 91091
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "Oh, look, Knightboat.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 91226,
      "endMs": 94413
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "And here's our TV next to the mirror.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 96528,
      "endMs": 99212
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "It looks like we have two.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 99413,
      "endMs": 101427
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "Two. Two.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 102836,
      "endMs": 103944
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "Yeah, yeah, two. Let's get to the baby pictures.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 104111,
      "endMs": 107601
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "Mom. That's exciting.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 108440,
      "endMs": 110085
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "Oh, please.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 110286,
      "endMs": 112199
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "Here's Bart sleeping.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 116293,
      "endMs": 117568
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "Here he is dozing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 117736,
      "endMs": 119346
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "Here he is after a visit from the sandman.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 119514,
      "endMs": 122232
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "Here's nappy time, Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 122400,
      "endMs": 124481
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "Here's a cute one. He's all tuckered out.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 124648,
      "endMs": 127467
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "Why aren't there any pictures of Maggie?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 127668,
      "endMs": 129984
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "Well, I'm glad you asked. It's actually a very interesting story.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 130621,
      "endMs": 135554
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "It all began about two years ago, before Maggie was even born.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 136528,
      "endMs": 139648
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "It was a tumultuous time for our nation.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 140437,
      "endMs": 142819
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "The clear-beverage craze gave us all a reason to live.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 143021,
      "endMs": 146075
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "The information superhighway showed the average person...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 146242,
      "endMs": 148893
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "...what some nerd thinks about Star Trek.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 149061,
      "endMs": 151410
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "And the domestication of the dog continued unabated.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 151578,
      "endMs": 155940
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "I was at my workstation when suddenly...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 156242,
      "endMs": 158625
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "Attention, American workers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 158793,
      "endMs": 160873
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "Your plant has been taken over by an all-star team of freelance terrorists.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 161075,
      "endMs": 165605
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "Not on my shift!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 166779,
      "endMs": 169296
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "No, you don't.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 177081,
      "endMs": 179128
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "Simpson, 10, terrorists, 8.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 180001,
      "endMs": 183088
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "Homer, tell the story right. Okay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 185403,
      "endMs": 188726
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "Homer, you should see a doctor.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 192685,
      "endMs": 194195
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "I don't think a healthy man can make that kind of smell.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 194363,
      "endMs": 197115
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "Your paychecks, gentlemen.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 197283,
      "endMs": 198692
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "This is it. With a single glorious check...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 202283,
      "endMs": 205269
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "...I'm finally completely out of debt.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 205437,
      "endMs": 208591
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "Yes! With my bills paid off, I can finally quit this lousy job.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 213759,
      "endMs": 217954
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "But, Homer, how you gonna make a living?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 218121,
      "endMs": 219967
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "Don't worry about Homer J. I've got a plan.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 220168,
      "endMs": 223155
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "A plan that'll fix you good. Hey, what did we do?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 223289,
      "endMs": 227383
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "Sorry, that just slipped out. I'll miss you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 227585,
      "endMs": 230437
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "Did you hear me? I said, I quit, Monty.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 230638,
      "endMs": 233457
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "And since I quit, I can do anything I want.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 233625,
      "endMs": 237115
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "Is that so?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 237316,
      "endMs": 238558
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "Lovely desk. It would be too bad if someone...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 239397,
      "endMs": 242215
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "...oh, I don't know, didn't use a coaster!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 242383,
      "endMs": 246075
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "Such a nice, tidy office.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 248826,
      "endMs": 250571
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "Maybe it's time you started living like a pig!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 250739,
      "endMs": 254195
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "Oh, I hope I haven't upset you...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 255974,
      "endMs": 258793
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "...bongo head!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 258927,
      "endMs": 260638
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "Oh, I should be resisting this, but I'm paralyzed with rage...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 264162,
      "endMs": 267417
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "...and island rhythms.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 267585,
      "endMs": 270303
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "Go, Homer. Yeah. Yeah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 270470,
      "endMs": 272551
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "Way to play the boss's head like a bongo, Homer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 273719,
      "endMs": 276001
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "He's getting a pretty good sound out of that guy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 276168,
      "endMs": 277846
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "That's for employing me for eight years.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 283752,
      "endMs": 286571
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "And that is that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 291135,
      "endMs": 293115
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "Goodbye, mind-numbing, backbreaking labor forever.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 293283,
      "endMs": 297679
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "Hello, dream job in paradise.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 297880,
      "endMs": 300967
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "And now, the final phase of my plan.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 304994,
      "endMs": 308551
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "Barney, any chance you can get me a job?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 312477,
      "endMs": 314390
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "Hey. Sure, Homer. I told you, my uncle owns the place.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 314558,
      "endMs": 319323
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "Hey, Uncle Al, can Homer have a job? Sure.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 319524,
      "endMs": 322746
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "Barney, you're fired. Okay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 325732,
      "endMs": 327645
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "Show up tomorrow. Bring three rags.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 327779,
      "endMs": 329625
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "Oh, and a change of pants.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 329793,
      "endMs": 331504
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "Why? When it happens, you'll know.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 331705,
      "endMs": 333585
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "You're a pin monkey?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 335598,
      "endMs": 337175
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "Finally, I don't have to be ashamed of my father's job.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 338182,
      "endMs": 340699
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "It's romantic, throwing off the shackles of the workaday world...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 340866,
      "endMs": 343887
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "...and following a dream, of sorts.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 344054,
      "endMs": 346202
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "I don't know if it's such a good idea.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 346403,
      "endMs": 348215
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "Can we get by on a pin monkey's salary?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 348383,
      "endMs": 350128
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "Don't worry, Marge.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 350296,
      "endMs": 351638
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "I've come up with a perfectly balanced budget.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 351806,
      "endMs": 354491
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "There will be exactly enough money for you, me, Bart and Lisa...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 354658,
      "endMs": 358819
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "...if we make a few small sacrifices.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 358987,
      "endMs": 361538
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "From now on, we use regular toilet paper...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 364558,
      "endMs": 367142
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "...not that fancy quilted kind.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 367309,
      "endMs": 369826
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "And only one of you kids can go to college.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 371605,
      "endMs": 373652
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "Fine. Fine.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 373853,
      "endMs": 375296
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "That night, your mom and I went out for a romantic evening...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 376806,
      "endMs": 379658
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "...to celebrate the start of our new life.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 379826,
      "endMs": 381739
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "We began with dinner and dancing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 381907,
      "endMs": 384189
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "Followed by a stroll on the beach.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 394960,
      "endMs": 398215
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "Marge. Homer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 403283,
      "endMs": 405833
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "I've got sand in my underpants.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 406034,
      "endMs": 408551
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "Me too. Let's go home.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 408786,
      "endMs": 410497
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "I love you, Marge.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 430799,
      "endMs": 432477
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "I love you too, Homie.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 432645,
      "endMs": 435128
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "Everything in our lives is finally perfectly balanced.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 435363,
      "endMs": 439088
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "I hope things stay exactly like this forever.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 439256,
      "endMs": 442444
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "Did you have to be so graphic?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 456327,
      "endMs": 458206
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "It's okay, Marge. They pave the way for this kind of filth in school.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 458407,
      "endMs": 462032
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "Dad, were you excited that Mom was pregnant?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 462233,
      "endMs": 464313
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "Actually, your mother hadn't told me yet.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 464548,
      "endMs": 466428
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "At that time, I had no idea Maggie even existed.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 466595,
      "endMs": 469917
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "Dad! Dad!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 471025,
      "endMs": 472636
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "Hi, Maggie.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 472803,
      "endMs": 474313
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "So anyhow, back then there was no way for me to know...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 474730,
      "endMs": 478186
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "...your mother was pregnant.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 478354,
      "endMs": 480266
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "Hey.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 481777,
      "endMs": 483320
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "Marge, you tie up the bathroom every morning. I've gotta wash my hair.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 484025,
      "endMs": 487683
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "The next few weeks at my dream job were like a wonderful waking coma.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 487917,
      "endMs": 492783
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "Hey, Homer. Hi there, Homer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 495602,
      "endMs": 497481
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "Hi, Homer. Hi there, Homer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 497649,
      "endMs": 499260
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "Hi.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 499428,
      "endMs": 500938
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "Bowling-fresh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 503891,
      "endMs": 506038
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "Urinal-fresh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 511508,
      "endMs": 513790
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "Homer, did you polish your head in the Shine-O Ball-O?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 523622,
      "endMs": 528119
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "No. Okay, then.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 528287,
      "endMs": 530602
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "I slowly learned the intricate mysteries of the alley...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 532515,
      "endMs": 535132
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "...like where the pins go after they're knocked down.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 535300,
      "endMs": 538219
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "I was in heaven. If horseracing is the sport of kings...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 557515,
      "endMs": 560602
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "...then surely, bowling...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 560736,
      "endMs": 562448
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "...is a very good sport as well.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 562615,
      "endMs": 565870
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "Hey, great job, Homer. Thanks a lot, Homer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 566072,
      "endMs": 568119
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "Hey, you're the best.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 568287,
      "endMs": 569931
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "I'm gonna make it after all",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 570132,
      "endMs": 575099
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "Congratulations, Mrs. Simpson. You're pregnant.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 577582,
      "endMs": 580199
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "Am I to take it that this is...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 582246,
      "endMs": 584293
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "...an unwanted pregnancy?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 585065,
      "endMs": 586810
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "Oh, no, no. Not exactly.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 586978,
      "endMs": 589629
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "It's just that I haven't told Homer yet. With his new job...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 589830,
      "endMs": 592582
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "...I don't know how we'll be able to afford this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 592750,
      "endMs": 595132
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "Well, you know, a healthy baby can bring upwards of $60,000.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 595300,
      "endMs": 599562
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "What?! Of course, that was just a test.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 599763,
      "endMs": 601911
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "Had you reacted differently, why, you'd be in jail right now. Simply a test.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 602079,
      "endMs": 606374
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "So in a few months, both of you will have a brand-new brother or sister.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 608186,
      "endMs": 611877
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "Been there, done that. I hope it's a girl.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 612045,
      "endMs": 614495
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "You know nothing about genetics, Lis. It goes boy, girl, boy, girl.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 614696,
      "endMs": 618354
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "You're worried about telling Dad. Why do you say that?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 618521,
      "endMs": 621777
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "Well, you've been in my room for about four hours now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 621944,
      "endMs": 624394
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "text": "Hey, I'm just hanging.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 624562,
      "endMs": 626542
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "text": "Homie, I... Can't talk. Praying.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 634394,
      "endMs": 636374
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "text": "Dear Lord, the gods have been good to me, and I am thankful.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 636542,
      "endMs": 640602
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "text": "For the first time in my life, everything is absolutely perfect...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 640770,
      "endMs": 644830
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "text": "...just the way it is.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 644998,
      "endMs": 647313
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "text": "So here's the deal: You freeze everything as it is...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 649187,
      "endMs": 651670
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "text": "...and I won't ask for anything more.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 651838,
      "endMs": 653550
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "text": "If that is okay, please give me absolutely no sign.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 653717,
      "endMs": 657140
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "text": "Okay, deal. In gratitude, I present you this offering of cookies and milk.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 657308,
      "endMs": 661905
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "text": "If you want me to eat them for you, give me no sign. Thy will be done.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 662073,
      "endMs": 666201
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "text": "I've got to tell Homer about this baby in just the right way...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 675966,
      "endMs": 679288
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "text": "...and at just the right time.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 679456,
      "endMs": 681268
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "text": "Until then, please keep this to yourselves.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 681436,
      "endMs": 683684
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "text": "If he found out now, it would probably destroy him, huh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 684154,
      "endMs": 687308
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "text": "Oh, yes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 687509,
      "endMs": 689019
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "text": "Gotta go. Gotta go.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 689254,
      "endMs": 690563
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "text": "Wait a minute. Wait. I know that look.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 690731,
      "endMs": 692879
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "text": "Now, promise you won't tell Homer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 693080,
      "endMs": 695026
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "text": "Oh, we promise we won't tell...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 695228,
      "endMs": 697375
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "text": "...Homer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 697543,
      "endMs": 699355
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "text": "Hello. Is this A. Aaronson?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 703583,
      "endMs": 706335
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "text": "It might interest you to know that Marge Simpson is pregnant again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 706503,
      "endMs": 710999
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "text": "Just thought you'd like to know, Mr. Zowkowski.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 713147,
      "endMs": 716066
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "text": "There. Aaronson and Zowkowski are the two biggest gossips in town.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 717375,
      "endMs": 721335
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "text": "In an hour, everyone will know.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 721503,
      "endMs": 723516
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "text": "Another perfect day in my perfect life with my perfect job.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 724993,
      "endMs": 729892
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "text": "Hey, just heard the news over the squawk box.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 730060,
      "endMs": 732744
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "text": "That's nice work, Homer. Thank you. Thank you very much.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 732879,
      "endMs": 735899
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "text": "It is nice work.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 736066,
      "endMs": 738113
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "text": "Oh, Mr. Simpson, I have just heard about the little bundle of joy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 738818,
      "endMs": 742308
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "text": "Congratulations, sir. It's true, the bundle is little...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 742476,
      "endMs": 745798
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "text": "...but I'm not in it for the money.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 745966,
      "endMs": 748885
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "text": "Hey, Homer, way to get Marge pregnant.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 750160,
      "endMs": 753214
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "text": "This is getting very abstract, but thank you...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 754321,
      "endMs": 756939
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "text": "...I do enjoy working at the bowling alley.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 757107,
      "endMs": 759791
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "text": "Surprise! Baby shower.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 760630,
      "endMs": 764422
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "text": "Baby shower? You know I haven't told Homer yet.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 764624,
      "endMs": 767610
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "text": "And he'll be home any minute.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 767778,
      "endMs": 769321
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "text": "Oh, really? Oh, really?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 769489,
      "endMs": 770899
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "text": "Man, it's windy as hell out there.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 775764,
      "endMs": 777946
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "text": "Hey, wait a minute. What are all these presents?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 778947,
      "endMs": 782672
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "text": "It looks like you're...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 782907,
      "endMs": 784215
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "text": "...showering Marge with gifts.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 784383,
      "endMs": 787168
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "text": "With little, tiny baby-sized gifts.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 787940,
      "endMs": 792202
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "text": "Well, I'll be in the tub.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 792840,
      "endMs": 796028
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "text": "By the way, congratulations on your new job, Homer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 796632,
      "endMs": 799450
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "text": "New job? Marge is pregnant?!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 799652,
      "endMs": 802638
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "text": "No!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 802806,
      "endMs": 805860
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "text": "Dad, you really threw a tantrum like a little sissy girl?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 809383,
      "endMs": 812202
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "text": "Oh, just that one time.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 812370,
      "endMs": 813645
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "text": "Actually, when I was about to have Bart...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 813813,
      "endMs": 816028
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "text": "You're pregnant?!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 816229,
      "endMs": 818175
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "text": "And then when I told him about Lisa...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 821833,
      "endMs": 824048
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "text": "You're pregnant again?!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 824249,
      "endMs": 825658
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "text": "Who wouldn't be upset?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 829987,
      "endMs": 831195
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "text": "That new baby in your mother's womb was a ticking time bomb...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 831397,
      "endMs": 834283
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "text": "...threatening to blow this family eight ways from Sunday.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 834450,
      "endMs": 837504
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "text": "Where are you going? You can't expect a person...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 837705,
      "endMs": 840021
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "text": "...to sit for 30 minutes straight.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 840189,
      "endMs": 841799
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "text": "I'm gonna get a snack and maybe go to the bathroom.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 841967,
      "endMs": 844350
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "text": "I'll stay here, but I'm gonna think about products I might like to purchase.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 844517,
      "endMs": 848410
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "text": "I don't have that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 852571,
      "endMs": 854215
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "text": "You're pregnant.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 857605,
      "endMs": 859014
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "text": "We're gonna have to have a baby. All our financial plans are ruined.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 859215,
      "endMs": 863242
    },
    {
      "index": 212,
      "text": "We're doomed. Doomed, I tells you!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 863444,
      "endMs": 866598
    },
    {
      "index": 213,
      "text": "Bart, let your father tell the story. Yeah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 869383,
      "endMs": 871732
    },
    {
      "index": 214,
      "text": "Okay, but I know funny. Anyhoo...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 871934,
      "endMs": 874517
    },
    {
      "index": 215,
      "text": "We're doomed!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 875726,
      "endMs": 877001
    },
    {
      "index": 216,
      "text": "Homer, you had a head. Check.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 877168,
      "endMs": 879081
    },
    {
      "index": 217,
      "text": "And your bottom was a little bigger.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 879249,
      "endMs": 881497
    },
    {
      "index": 218,
      "text": "You've worked hard at the bowling alley.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 881871,
      "endMs": 883918
    },
    {
      "index": 219,
      "text": "Why don't you ask for a raise. Yeah, a raise.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 884086,
      "endMs": 886804
    },
    {
      "index": 220,
      "text": "I've never been good enough at any job to deserve one.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 887005,
      "endMs": 889455
    },
    {
      "index": 221,
      "text": "But I'm damn good at this one. That's it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 889623,
      "endMs": 892307
    },
    {
      "index": 222,
      "text": "I'm gonna march right up to Al and say: Steve. I mean, Al, I think I deserve a raise.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 892442,
      "endMs": 898247
    },
    {
      "index": 223,
      "text": "You're a hard worker. I'd like to give you a raise.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 898448,
      "endMs": 900864
    },
    {
      "index": 224,
      "text": "But the alley just ain't doing enough business to pay that kind of money.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 901032,
      "endMs": 904522
    },
    {
      "index": 225,
      "text": "How about if I triple the business? Then could I get a raise?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 904724,
      "endMs": 908851
    },
    {
      "index": 226,
      "text": "Well, yeah, but...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 909052,
      "endMs": 910764
    },
    {
      "index": 227,
      "text": "Of course.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 934724,
      "endMs": 936301
    },
    {
      "index": 228,
      "text": "Bowling. Bowling here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 938415,
      "endMs": 939858
    },
    {
      "index": 229,
      "text": "Come bowl now. Get your bowling.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 940026,
      "endMs": 942375
    },
    {
      "index": 230,
      "text": "Who's ready? Bowling.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 942542,
      "endMs": 944388
    },
    {
      "index": 231,
      "text": "Mom, make Dad tell the story right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 944589,
      "endMs": 946905
    },
    {
      "index": 232,
      "text": "That's what really happened.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 947106,
      "endMs": 949119
    },
    {
      "index": 233,
      "text": "My marketing plan attracted a record number of police and fire officials...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 949925,
      "endMs": 953381
    },
    {
      "index": 234,
      "text": "...but few stayed to bowl. I failed.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 953549,
      "endMs": 956838
    },
    {
      "index": 235,
      "text": "Quitting my dream job was the hardest thing I've ever done.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 957005,
      "endMs": 961200
    },
    {
      "index": 236,
      "text": "You did a great job, Homer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 961368,
      "endMs": 963012
    },
    {
      "index": 237,
      "text": "I'm really gonna miss you. Place has never been cleaner.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 963213,
      "endMs": 965898
    },
    {
      "index": 238,
      "text": "And the way you kept the young people away, that was beautiful.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 966066,
      "endMs": 969287
    },
    {
      "index": 239,
      "text": "Oh, yeah. Thanks for that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 969489,
      "endMs": 971133
    },
    {
      "index": 240,
      "text": "Anyway, we all pitched in, and we got you this little going-away thing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 971334,
      "endMs": 975529
    },
    {
      "index": 241,
      "text": "This was the happiest time of my life.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 980026,
      "endMs": 982710
    },
    {
      "index": 242,
      "text": "I'll never forget you guys.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 982844,
      "endMs": 984891
    },
    {
      "index": 243,
      "text": "Especially you, Joey.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 985059,
      "endMs": 987375
    },
    {
      "index": 244,
      "text": "See you around, Mr. Homer. Don't worry, Joey.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 987576,
      "endMs": 989858
    },
    {
      "index": 245,
      "text": "We'll make it to California someday.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 990026,
      "endMs": 992475
    },
    {
      "index": 246,
      "text": "Sure, we will, Mr. Homer. Sure, we will.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 992677,
      "endMs": 995093
    },
    {
      "index": 247,
      "text": "It's gonna be sad around here without you, Homer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 997408,
      "endMs": 999891
    },
    {
      "index": 248,
      "text": "Yeah. Sure is.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1000059,
      "endMs": 1002106
    },
    {
      "index": 249,
      "text": "Boy, this is depressing. I know what'd cheer us up. Bowling.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1004791,
      "endMs": 1008750
    },
    {
      "index": 250,
      "text": "Look at this, I got a ball here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1011838,
      "endMs": 1013918
    },
    {
      "index": 251,
      "text": "I needed more money to support my growing family.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1015479,
      "endMs": 1018130
    },
    {
      "index": 252,
      "text": "And there was only one place in town that a man like me could make it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1018297,
      "endMs": 1023096
    },
    {
      "index": 253,
      "text": "Acid rain again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1037928,
      "endMs": 1040378
    },
    {
      "index": 254,
      "text": "Yes? Are you a new applicant?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1055948,
      "endMs": 1058029
    },
    {
      "index": 255,
      "text": "I quit, and I came to get my job back. Through there.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1058230,
      "endMs": 1061955
    },
    {
      "index": 256,
      "text": "So come crawling back, eh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1070445,
      "endMs": 1073264
    },
    {
      "index": 257,
      "text": "Seems like the classy thing to do would be not to call attention to it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1073465,
      "endMs": 1077190
    },
    {
      "index": 258,
      "text": "Thanks for giving me my old job back. I'm afraid it's not that simple.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1077391,
      "endMs": 1081653
    },
    {
      "index": 259,
      "text": "As punishment for your desertion...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1081821,
      "endMs": 1083633
    },
    {
      "index": 260,
      "text": "...it's company policy to give you the plague.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1083801,
      "endMs": 1087425
    },
    {
      "index": 261,
      "text": "Sir, that's the \"plaque.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1087626,
      "endMs": 1089270
    },
    {
      "index": 262,
      "text": "Yes, the special de-motivational plaque...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1089472,
      "endMs": 1092559
    },
    {
      "index": 263,
      "text": "...to break what's left of your spirit.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1092693,
      "endMs": 1095378
    },
    {
      "index": 264,
      "text": "Because, you see, you're here forever.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1095512,
      "endMs": 1099606
    },
    {
      "index": 265,
      "text": "\"Don't forget: You're here forever.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1102224,
      "endMs": 1104673
    },
    {
      "index": 266,
      "text": "I've never been so miserable in all my life.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1110814,
      "endMs": 1113734
    },
    {
      "index": 267,
      "text": "But I can't take it out on Marge and the kids.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1113901,
      "endMs": 1116116
    },
    {
      "index": 268,
      "text": "I've gotta carry the burden all by myself.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1116317,
      "endMs": 1119707
    },
    {
      "index": 269,
      "text": "Hi, honey. How are you? Well, actually...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1121217,
      "endMs": 1123499
    },
    {
      "index": 270,
      "text": "Oh, I can't go on with this charade. I hate my job. I hate my life.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1123666,
      "endMs": 1127224
    },
    {
      "index": 271,
      "text": "Since I found out about this baby, there's been only bad luck.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1127391,
      "endMs": 1130344
    },
    {
      "index": 272,
      "text": "My contractions started an hour ago.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1130546,
      "endMs": 1132760
    },
    {
      "index": 273,
      "text": "Just in one ear and out the other with you, isn't it?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1132962,
      "endMs": 1135747
    },
    {
      "index": 274,
      "text": "It's wonderful. It's magical. Oh, boy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1137210,
      "endMs": 1140096
    },
    {
      "index": 275,
      "text": "Here it comes, another mouth.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1140264,
      "endMs": 1142915
    },
    {
      "index": 276,
      "text": "One more push should do it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1143116,
      "endMs": 1145130
    },
    {
      "index": 277,
      "text": "Marvelous.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1145297,
      "endMs": 1146942
    },
    {
      "index": 278,
      "text": "Congratulations, Mr. Simpson. You have a beautiful, healthy baby.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1150364,
      "endMs": 1154324
    },
    {
      "index": 279,
      "text": "Okay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1154526,
      "endMs": 1156875
    },
    {
      "index": 280,
      "text": "Homie, I think someone is saying hello.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1160465,
      "endMs": 1163015
    },
    {
      "index": 281,
      "text": "Hello.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1163217,
      "endMs": 1164291
    },
    {
      "index": 282,
      "text": "It's a boy. And what a boy!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1166405,
      "endMs": 1169626
    },
    {
      "index": 283,
      "text": "That's the umbilical cord. It's a girl.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1170398,
      "endMs": 1173351
    },
    {
      "index": 284,
      "text": "A girl. Oh, Marge, we have a wonderful baby girl.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1173552,
      "endMs": 1178385
    },
    {
      "index": 285,
      "text": "Not just a girl. The most beautiful baby girl in the whole world.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1178552,
      "endMs": 1183922
    },
    {
      "index": 286,
      "text": "Come on, Marge, show a little enthusiasm.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1186136,
      "endMs": 1188385
    },
    {
      "index": 287,
      "text": "So you loved her right from the start.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1196036,
      "endMs": 1198150
    },
    {
      "index": 288,
      "text": "Absolutely.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1199995,
      "endMs": 1201472
    },
    {
      "index": 289,
      "text": "Then why no pictures? Oh, there are pictures.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1201673,
      "endMs": 1204861
    },
    {
      "index": 290,
      "text": "I keep them where I need the most cheering up. www.tvsubtitles.net",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1205062,
      "endMs": 2000
    }
  ],
  "meta": {
    "show": "The Simpsons",
    "season": 6,
    "episode": 13
  }
}
